    "body": "I merged upstream/main (clean), then ran `scripts/gate.sh quick`.\n- All app and post suites are green, including the new probe-sign pins and goldens.\n- The remaining reds also fail on upstream main: `swarf_pose_continuity` (fixed by #351) and the GPU headless tests.\n\n**For the maintainer:** this changes posted Fanuc probe output (edge and outside-corner modes at negative coordinates). The contributor's only simulator is PathPilot Hub (Tormach / LinuxCNC). It cannot run Fanuc macro B (`#100`/`#5061`, `IF[...]`), so no hands-on controller check was possible.\n- The new goldens assert that no posted line contains `--` or `+-`.\n- A bore-centre probe posts exactly as before.\n- A run on a Fanuc control or simulator is yours to judge. Marking ready on that basis.\n",
